(global_label "VIDEO_OUT" (shape bidirectional) (at 556.26 242.57 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "52f91344-7129-549c-b335-4e26ed7585c1") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 556.26 242.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
(text "OSD BLOCK (Rev 13.0) - U5 AT7456E (LCSC C82351), datasheet AT7456E-S402-V1.1 (DS)\n- Pinout DS p.6: 1/2/14-16/27/28 NC, 3 DVDD, 4 DGND, 5 CLKIN, 6 XFB, 7 CLKOUT, 8 /CS, 9 SDIN, 10 SCLK, 11 SDOUT,\n  12 LOS, 13 SYNC_IN, 17 /VSYNC, 18 /HSYNC, 19 /RESET, 20 AGND, 21 AVDD, 22 VIN, 23 PGND, 24 PVDD, 25 SAG, 26 VOUT, EP=AGND.\n- All three supplies on +3V3_OSD (3.15-5.25 V, DS p.2): SDOUT swings 0..3.3 V into PB14 and every MCU-driven\n  input stays inside its VDVDD+0.3 V abs max. AVDD min 3.15 V needs +3V3 >= 3.18 V at the FB5 input.\n- SPI2 MODE0 (SDIN sampled on SCLK rise, SDOUT on fall, DS p.4). hwdef SPIDEV osd 8*MHZ -> 80 MHz/16 = 5 MHz\n  (tCP 200 ns vs 100 ns min). AP_OSD_MAX7456 polls STAT: LOS, /VSYNC, /HSYNC, SYNC_IN, CLKOUT unused (NC).\n- NVM read (CMM=0x50) needs >= 22 us on the AT7456E (DS p.36) vs 0.5 us MAX7456: see ardupilot/patches/0003.\n- 27 MHz crystal Y3 straight between CLKIN/XFB with no load caps (DS Fig.2); VIN 75R + 100 nF AC coupling;\n  VOUT -> C32 22u, SAG -> C33 22u -> R28 75R back-termination -> VIDEO_OUT (2.0 V/V gain, Zout 0.22R, DS p.3).\nLAYOUT RULES\n- R30-R32 within 3 mm of U1 pins 52/54/51; R33 within 3 mm of U5 pin 11. SPI2 over solid In1 GND.\n- C28/C29/C30 within 1 mm of U5 pins 3/21/24; EP 29 soldered to GND with >= 6 vias (thermal + AGND star);\n  DGND 4 / AGND 20 / PGND 23 return into the EP island - never as the only ground path (DS p.6).\n- Y3 within 3 mm of pins 5/6, GND guard, no SPI/video traces under it. VIDEO_IN/OUT 75R-ish traces,\n  >= 3x width from SPI2 and from the BEC SW node / L1; C31 and R28 at U5 pins 22 / 26.\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 281.94 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "559b44be-7702-5ba9-83e3-1fbd7117ec98"))
(text "9 V / 12 V 2 A VTX BEC (Rev 13.0): TPS62933 500 kHz, Q1 FB switch (fails to 9 V), DJI 6-pin SH1.0 VTX connector" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 396.24 288.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "388848c2-099c-56a7-9289-f81e15cc3844"))
