(text "VTX BEC + CONNECTOR (Rev 13.0) - U6 TPS62933DRLR (LCSC C3200405), TI SLUSEA4D\n- VBAT -> U6 (VIN 3.8-30 V, 2S-6S) -> L1 10uH -> +VTX. Vout = 0.8 V x (1 + 102k/Rbot): Q1 off Rbot 10k = 8.96 V,\n  Q1 on 10k||26.7k = 12.02 V. Corners 8.62-9.33 / 11.54-12.50 V (Vref 784-816 mV + 1 % R corners, analysis/osd_vtx_bec_report.json).\n  12 V corner can exceed HDZero's 12 V max: HDZero stays on 9 V.\n- Failsafe: PD11 high-Z (reset, bootloader) -> R38 100k holds Q1 off -> 9 V. 12 V only while firmware drives\n  VTX_12V_SEL high (RELAY3, default 0); 12->9 V trips 115% OVP harmlessly (FB 1.07 V, DS 9.3.11).\n- EN: VTX_PWR (PD10) -> R39 1k; internal pull-up => VTX on while PD10 is high-Z; RELAY2_DEFAULT 1 (defaults.parm).\n- 12 V regulates only from 13.38 V in at 2 A (Dmax 0.93 at 500 kHz, hot) => 4S only; 9 V needs ~10 V (3S ok).\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 385.445 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d78614f9-dca8-5a19-b3d6-ab4404f031d2"))
(text "- Sense R40 10k / R41 1k: x11.0 = BATT2_VOLT_MULT, BATT2_VOLT_PIN 8 = PC5 ADC1_INP8 (STM32H743xx.py:1289).\n- J1 JST SH 1 A/contact: DJI O3 (16 W) must use the J2 solder pair for +VTX/GND; J1 then carries data only.\nLAYOUT RULES\n- C34/C35/C36 at U6 pins 3/4 (shortest VIN-GND loop); SW node (pin 5, L1, C37) minimal copper, no vias,\n  >= 5 mm from U5/Y3, video and IMU parts; L1 pad-to-pad, output caps C39-C42 return to U6 GND pin 4.\n- FB network R34/R35/R36/Q1 at U6 pin 8, away from SW; Kelvin-sense +VTX at C39. R40/R41/C43 at U1 PC5.\n- U6 thermal: RthJA 60.2 K/W (EVM) -> pour GND around pin 4 with vias. J1/J2 at the board edge, +VTX >= 1 mm.\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 177.8 385.445 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "398c9dd2-9762-591e-9932-6eacdc99d7e6"))
(text "DroneCAN / CAN FD PHY (Rev 14.0): TCAN334G, split 120R termination, CAN-FD ESD array, JST-GH" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 609.6 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36ee2923-e6d2-5343-b64c-50db3929a269"))
